# GMS's third Frailty Curse hyper deepens the Speed penalty, which this game
# has no ground to model. Renamed for DEF instead, the way both archers'
# Sharp Eyes - Bulwark was -- and worth as little, deliberately: DEF stops
# paying at a share of the attacking monster's attack, and a 4th job has passed
# that cap on their stats alone.
name: "Frailty Curse - Bulwark"
skill_order: 8
description: "Grants Frailty Curse a bonus to DEF."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_NIGHT_LORD
hyper: true
required_level: 165
max_level: 1
base { def: 500 }
